sunxi-g2d-m2m
=================

Minimal skeleton driver for the Allwinner Sunxi G2D memory-to-memory engine.

Device tree binding (basic):

compatible: "allwinner,sun8i-g2d"
reg: registers
interrupts: optional IRQ
clocks: optional clock

This README is a placeholder. Extend the driver to implement format
conversions, DMA, and synchronization for the specific SoC variant.
